GAME	游戏
Find its *lair* and *CHALLENGE* it: learn its tricks!	找到它的*巢穴*并*挑战*它：摸清它的套路！
A legend of its land: a *red aura* and its own HP bar.	当地的传奇怪物：自带*红光*和专属HP条。
Hunt it down (the *edge arrow* shows the way), then lead your squad to it.	循着*屏幕边缘的箭头*找到它，然后带领小队过去。
Its *helmet* soaks up your hits until it cracks.	它的*头盔*会吸收你的攻击，直到碎裂。
Crack the helmet with a few hits, then drop your heroes in.	打几下敲碎头盔，再投放英雄。
Wanted! It *flees*, and its bounty *shrinks* every second.	悬赏！它会*逃跑*，赏金每秒都在*缩水*。
Get your squad on it: their target is *pinned* and every hit lands in full.	让小队追上它：目标会被*定住*，每一击都能造成全额伤害。
A masked thief: it *steals your coins* off the ground.	蒙面小贼：它会*偷走你掉在地上的金币*。
Grab your coins fast. Kill it: it *spills* its sack!	赶紧把金币捡起来。干掉它：它的钱袋会*洒一地*！
A healer on the wrong team: it *heals* the slimes nearby.	站错队的奶妈：它会*治疗*附近的史莱姆。
Take it out *first*: lead your squad to it.	*优先*干掉它：带领小队过去。
Two flee at once: a tough *gold* one, a fast *gem* one.	两个同时开溜：一个是耐打的*黄金*跑者，一个是飞快的*宝石*跑者。
Catch *ONE*: the other runs off. Drop your heroes by your pick!	只能抓*一个*：另一个会跑掉。把英雄放到你选的那个旁边！
A *glowing ring* lights up on the map for a while.	地图上会亮起一个*发光圆环*，持续一段时间。
Fight *inside the ring*!	在*圆环内*战斗！
