Hold [W] [A] [S] [D] or *drag with the right or middle button* to move your *view*: more slimes out there!	按住[W] [A] [S] [D]或*用右键或中键拖动*来移动*视野*：外面还有更多史莱姆！
You have *heroes in hand*. *Click* the ground to place one, *drag* a line to place more, *click* a placed hero to *pick him up*. Heroes *stay where you put them*: [Q] *Regroup* brings them all to your screen. Your *Barbarian* walks by himself: he *roars* at one hero, who attacks *faster*, and *throws* slimes into packs.	你的*手牌里有英雄*。*点击*地面放置一名，*拖动*划线放置多名，*点击*场上英雄可将其*拿起*。英雄*放哪就待哪*：按[Q]*集结*可全部召回屏幕。*野蛮人*会自行游走：他会对一位英雄*大吼*，使其攻击*更快*，还会把史莱姆*扔*进怪群。
[LMB] place or pick up a hero, [Q] regroup, [RMB] [MMB] drag: move the view, [{0}] [{1}] [{2}] [{3}] ultimates, [E] Lair Wing.	[LMB]放置或拿起英雄，[Q]集结，[RMB][MMB]拖动视野，[{0}][{1}][{2}][{3}]终极技能，[E]巢穴之翼。
*CROWN GUARDS*, then *THE REAL ONE*: one trick at a time.	*王冠护卫*之后是*真身*：一次一招。
Hunt it down (the *edge arrow* shows the way), then *place* your heroes by it.	找到它（*边缘箭头*会指路），再把英雄*放置*在它身边。
Crack the helmet with *quick hits*: Volley and Twin Daggers do it fastest.	用*快速连击*敲碎头盔：齐射和双匕首最快。
*Place* your heroes by it: it's *pinned* and every hit lands in full.	把英雄*放置*在它身边：它会被*定住*，每一击都能造成全额伤害。
Take it out *first*: *place* your heroes next to it.	*优先*干掉它：把英雄*放置*在它旁边。
Catch *ONE*: the other runs off. *Place* your heroes by your pick!	只能抓*一个*：另一个会跑掉。把英雄*放置*在你选的那个旁边！
It splits twice: find *THE REAL ONE* by its crown!	它会分裂两次：认准王冠，找出*真身*！
Hold	坚守
Thunder	雷法师
Blade	剑圣
Shoots the *nearest slime*. *Volley* adds arrows, up to {0}.	射击*最近的史莱姆*。*齐射*可增加箭数，最多{0}支。
WHERE TO PLACE	放置地点
*Place* her anywhere: the whole screen is her range.	把她*放置*在哪都行：整个屏幕都是她的射程。
*Place* your heroes *right next to it*.	把英雄*放置*在*它身边*。
Always in your army	始终在你的军队中
Bring *crits* and *area damage*; *place* your heroes by the big ones.	带上*暴击*和*范围伤害*；把英雄*放置*在大家伙身边。
Only a *strong army* farms it: *upgrade* first.	只有*强大的军队*才刷得动它：先去*强化*。
*Place* your heroes next to it!	把英雄*放置*在它旁边！
Tons of HP, hardly any gold: it *soaks up* your heroes' shots.	血超厚，钱超少：专门*吸走*英雄的火力。
It splits: find *THE REAL ONE* by its glinting *crown*!	它会分裂：认准闪光的*王冠*，找出*真身*！
Get out of its *red circle*: a slam that stuns nobody *dazes* it!	躲开它的*红圈*：猛砸没震晕任何人，它就会*眩晕*！
Its slams strike *under your heroes*: pick them up, place them out!	它的猛砸会落在*英雄脚下*：快把他们拿起来，放到外面！
Two trios of *CROWN GUARDS*: down them all, then hit it *DAZED*!	两组*王冠护卫*，每组三名：全部击倒，再趁它*眩晕*时猛攻！
It slams round itself and under your heroes: keep them *out of the red*!	它会猛砸自身周围和英雄脚下：让英雄*远离红圈*！
Down its guards' trios and dodge its *red circles*!	击倒护卫三人组，并躲开它的*红圈*！
Its last fight uses all three tricks: *guards*, *slams*, then *the real one*.	最后一战三招齐出：*护卫*、*猛砸*，然后是*真身*。
Get the spot on screen: a strong army *cashes in*.	把视野移到落点：强大的军队能*大赚一笔*。
*Place* your heroes in their path and catch them!	把英雄*放置*在它们的路线上，逮住它们！
*Place* your heroes *out of their path*!	把英雄*放置*在*它们的路线外*！
Hit it! *Place* your heroes by it: more heroes hit it, more loot.	揍它！把英雄*放置*在它身边：打它的英雄越多，战利品越多。
*Place* your heroes by it: it's *pinned* down!	把英雄*放置*在它身边：它会被*定住*！
[RMB] *Right-click* a slime: the Barbarian throws it into the *biggest pack*.	[RMB]*右键*点击史莱姆：野蛮人会把它扔进*最大的怪群*。
The Archer line's *ULTIMATE*: press [{0}] or click its tile, then *click* where it lands.	弓箭手系的*终极技能*：按[{0}]或点击技能图标，再*点击*落点。
The Mage line's *ULTIMATE*: press [{0}] or click its tile: bolts strike the slimes on screen.	法师系的*终极技能*：按[{0}]或点击技能图标，闪电就会劈向屏幕上的史莱姆。
Fill the chest in *one run*: it turns *Silver*, *Gold*, then *Diamond*.	在*一局*内装满宝箱：它会依次升级为*白银*、*黄金*、*钻石*宝箱。
*Bags* drop from slimes: *gear* for your lines, rolled so no two are alike.	史莱姆会掉落*物品袋*：里面是各系英雄的*装备*，属性随机，件件不同。
Better gear *equips itself*: see it in the *WARBAND* tab.	更好的装备会*自动换上*：到*战团*标签页查看。
At the Warband's *forge*, refine a *slot*: every item you put in it gets stronger.	在战团的*锻造炉*精炼*栏位*：放进去的每件物品都会变强。
From *+{0}* it needs *Oridecon* and can *fail*.	从*+{0}*起需要*神之金属*，而且可能*失败*。
Slot the cards that fit your *army* in the *CARDS* tab.	在*卡牌*标签页装入适合你*军队*的卡牌。
The Rogue line's *ULTIMATE*: press [{0}] or click its tile. Rogues strike *twice as fast*, kills drop *double loot*.	盗贼系的*终极技能*：按[{0}]或点击技能图标。盗贼*攻速翻倍*，击杀掉落*双倍战利品*。
Save it for a *Mimic*, a *Golden Slime* or a *dazed* boss.	留给*宝箱怪*、*黄金史莱姆*或*眩晕*的首领。
The Swordsman line's *ULTIMATE*: press [{0}] or click its tile. Slimes on screen *slide* to your Swordsmen.	剑士系的*终极技能*：按[{0}]或点击技能图标。屏幕上的史莱姆会*滑向*你的剑士。
Fire it when the slimes are *spread out*.	等史莱姆*四散*时再释放。
Fewer, heavier arrows that *pierce* the slimes in a line.	箭更少也更重，能*贯穿*一条线上的史莱姆。
*Place* him facing a *line* of slimes.	把他*放置*在正对*一排*史莱姆的位置。
RANGER	游侠
Every *{0}th arrow* is a *Power Shot*: it goes through its whole line and always crits.	每*{0}支箭*就有一支*强力射击*：贯穿整条线，且必定暴击。
*Kings* and *Stones* are his job.	*史莱姆王*和*岩石史莱姆*就交给他了。
His lightning hits every slime in a *small circle*.	他的闪电会击中*小范围*内的所有史莱姆。
*Place* him next to *crowds*.	把他*放置*在*怪群*旁边。
*Chain Lightning*: each strike jumps on to {0} more slimes.	*闪电链*：每次攻击还会跳向另外{0}只史莱姆。
*Place* him by *packs*: every jump finds a slime.	把他*放置*在*怪群*旁边：每次跳跃都不落空。
ARCHMAGE	大法师
*Chain Reaction*: a charged slime that dies sends a *free jump*.	*连锁反应*：带电的史莱姆死亡时，会发出一次*额外跳跃*。
*Place* him in the *thick* of a pack.	把他*放置*在怪群*最密集处*。
He dashes out from his spot, cuts a slime and dashes back. His hits knock out *bonus coins*.	他从原地冲出，砍一刀史莱姆再冲回来。攻击能打出*额外金币*。
*Place* him by slimes *worth robbing*.	把他*放置*在*值得打劫*的史莱姆旁边。
*Execute*: a slime under *{0}% HP* dies at once (never the boss).	*斩杀*：*HP低于{0}%*的史莱姆立即死亡（首领除外）。
*Place* him by *tough slimes*: he finishes them.	把他*放置*在*耐打的史莱姆*旁边：由他来收尾。
NIGHTBLADE	夜刃
*Mark for Death*: he marks the richest slime; its kill drops *double loot*.	*死亡标记*：他会标记最值钱的史莱姆，击杀它掉落*双倍战利品*。
*Golden Slimes* first: keep him near them.	*黄金史莱姆*优先：让他守在附近。
SWORDSMAN	剑士
He *guards* a circle around his spot and *sweeps* every slime in reach.	他*守住*身边一圈，*横扫*范围内的所有史莱姆。
*Place* him next to *packs*.	把他*放置*在*怪群*旁边。
KNIGHT	骑士
*Shield Bash*: every few seconds he charges and piles slimes up.	*盾击*：每隔几秒他就会冲锋，把史莱姆撞成一堆。
*Place* him where slimes *crowd in*.	把他*放置*在史莱姆*扎堆*的地方。
BLADEMASTER	剑圣
*Whirlwind*: every {0} s he spins, {1} hits on every slime in reach.	*旋风斩*：每{0}秒旋转一次，对范围内每只史莱姆造成{1}次打击。
*Place* him in the *middle* of a pack.	把他*放置*在怪群*正中央*。
He runs out by himself for the *coins* left on the ground, even just off screen.	他会自己跑去捡地上的*金币*，刚出屏幕的也不放过。
He empties his sack into the *chest*.	他会把袋子里的东西全倒进*宝箱*。
Its lair! Challenge it at its plaque: one try a run.	它的巢穴！在牌匾处发起挑战：每局一次机会。
Spend gold on *skills*. Each one makes your *heroes* stronger for every run.	花金币购买*技能*。每个技能都会让你的*英雄*永久变强。
You have *heroes in hand*. *Click* the ground to place one, *drag* a line to place more, *click* a placed hero to *pick him up*. Heroes *stay where you put them*: [Q] *Regroup* brings them all to your screen.	你的*手牌里有英雄*。*点击*地面放置一名，*拖动*划线放置多名，*点击*场上英雄可将其*拿起*。英雄*放哪就待哪*：按[Q]*集结*可全部召回屏幕。
Move your *view* with the *right stick* [RS].	用*右摇杆*[RS]移动*视野*。
Move your view with WASD or the arrow keys	用 WASD 或方向键移动视野
{0} heroes on a quest: {1} run left.	{0}名英雄正在执行任务：还剩{1}局。
{0} hero on a quest: {1} run left.	{0}名英雄正在执行任务：还剩{1}局。
It tracks *here* in the trial's words: fill it in *one run* to earn the *ULTIMATE*!	试炼进度显示在*这里*：在*一局*内填满，就能获得*终极技能*！
*HEIST* is ready: press [{0}]. Best on a *dazed* boss.	*大劫案*已就绪：按[{0}]。最好用在*眩晕*的首领身上。
*Rare* gear and cards can drop from now on.	从现在起，可能掉落*稀有*装备和卡牌。
RARE LOOT!	稀有战利品！
Your first *gear* is in! See it in the *WARBAND*.	第一件*装备*到手了！去*战团*看看吧。
Gear belongs to the *line*, not the hero, so it stays through *Job Changes* and *quests*.	装备属于*英雄系*，而非单个英雄，所以*转职*或外出*任务*都不会丢。
Better gear *equips itself* (NEW BEST).	更好的装备会*自动换上*（更强）。
You refine the *slot*, not the item: every item you put there *keeps* it.	精炼的是*栏位*，不是物品：放进去的每件物品都*享有*精炼效果。
A *must-have*: [SHIFT] *War Cry*, every hero attacks *faster* for a few seconds.	*必备技能*：按[SHIFT]发动*战吼*，几秒内所有英雄攻击*更快*。
Drag or use [W] [A] [S] [D] to see the whole tree. The *wheel* zooms out.	拖动或用[W] [A] [S] [D]查看整棵技能树。*滚轮*可缩小视图。
Your heroes *stay where you put them*. [Q] *Regroup* brings them all here.	英雄*放哪就待哪*。按[Q]*集结*可全部召回这里。
*Click* a placed hero to *pick him up*. *Click* again to *place* him.	*点击*场上英雄可将其*拿起*，再次*点击*即可*放置*。
PICK UP A HERO	拿起英雄
His lightning hits every slime in a *small circle*. *Place* him next to *crowds*.	他的闪电会击中*小范围*内的所有史莱姆。把他*放置*在*怪群*旁边。
Your *Barbarian* is in your hand: *place* him! He *walks* by himself, *roars* at one hero, who attacks *faster*, and *throws* slimes into packs.	*野蛮人*已在你的手牌中：*放置*他吧！他会自行*游走*，对一位英雄*大吼*，使其攻击*更快*，还会把史莱姆*扔*进怪群。
The *Barbarian* walks by himself: he *roars* at one hero, who attacks *faster*, and *throws* slimes into packs.	*野蛮人*会自行游走：他会对一位英雄*大吼*，使其攻击*更快*，还会把史莱姆*扔*进怪群。
Your *Goblin* runs out by himself for the *coins* left on the ground, even just off screen!	你的*哥布林*会自己跑去捡地上的*金币*，刚出屏幕的也不放过！
*Epic* gear and cards can drop from now on.	从现在起，可能掉落*史诗*装备和卡牌。
EPIC LOOT!	史诗战利品！
*Legendary* gear and cards can drop from now on.	从现在起，可能掉落*传说*装备和卡牌。
LEGENDARY LOOT!	传说战利品！
He *dashes out* from his spot, cuts a slime and dashes back. His hits knock out *bonus coins*.	他从原地*冲出*，砍一刀史莱姆再冲回来。攻击能打出*额外金币*。
He *guards* a circle around his spot and *sweeps* every slime in reach. *Place* him next to *packs*.	他*守住*身边一圈，*横扫*范围内的所有史莱姆。把他*放置*在*怪群*旁边。
Your *{0} Archers* became one *HUNTER*! His arrows *pierce* the slimes in a line.	*{0}名弓箭手*转职为一名*猎手*！他的箭会*贯穿*一条线上的史莱姆。
He keeps every upgrade and hits harder than the three did together.	他保留所有强化，伤害比三人加起来还高。
Your *{0} Wizards* became one *THUNDER MAGE*! His lightning *jumps on* to {1} more slimes.	*{0}名巫师*转职为一名*雷法师*！他的闪电会*跳到*另外{1}只史莱姆身上。
Your *{0} Rogues* became one *ASSASSIN*! A slime under *{1}% HP* dies to his strike at once.	*{0}名盗贼*转职为一名*刺客*！*HP低于{1}%*的史莱姆会被他一击毙命。
Your *{0} Swordsmen* became one *KNIGHT*! His *Shield Bash* piles slimes up in front of him.	*{0}名剑士*转职为一名*骑士*！他的*盾击*会把史莱姆堆到身前。
Your *{0} Hunters* became one *RANGER*! Every *{1}th arrow* is a *Power Shot*.	*{0}名猎手*转职为一名*游侠*！每*{1}支箭*就有一支是*强力射击*。
Your *{0} Thunder Mages* became one *ARCHMAGE*! Slimes his chain hits stay *charged*: one that dies sends a *free jump*.	*{0}名雷法师*转职为一名*大法师*！被他的闪电链击中的史莱姆会保持*带电*：死亡时发出一次*额外跳跃*。
Your *{0} Assassins* became one *NIGHTBLADE*! He *marks* the richest slime: its kill drops *double loot*.	*{0}名刺客*转职为一名*夜刃*！他会*标记*最富有的史莱姆：击杀它掉落*双倍战利品*。
Your *{0} Knights* became one *BLADEMASTER*! Every *{1} s* he spins a *Whirlwind* through every slime in reach.	*{0}名骑士*转职为一名*剑圣*！每*{1}秒*他会发动一次*旋风斩*，打击范围内的所有史莱姆。
Press [E]: your view flies to the *boss's lair*. *Once* a run.	按[E]：视野直飞*首领巢穴*。每局限*一次*。
*ARROW RAIN* is ready: press [{0}], then *click* where it falls. Best on a *dazed* boss.	*箭雨*已就绪：按[{0}]，再*点击*落点。最好用在*眩晕*的首领身上。
*STORM CALL* is ready: press [{0}]. Best on a *dazed* boss.	*召唤风暴*已就绪：按[{0}]。最好用在*眩晕*的首领身上。
*HOLD THE LINE* is ready: press [{0}]. Best on a *dazed* boss.	*坚守阵线*已就绪：按[{0}]。最好用在*眩晕*的首领身上。
A *bubble* shields the boss while its *guards* stand. *Place* your heroes *next to a guard*: they hit the *nearest* one!	只要*护卫*还在，首领就有*泡泡*护体。把英雄*放置*在*护卫旁边*：他们会攻击*最近*的那个！
Only the *real one's crown glints*. *Place* your heroes *next to it*: they hit it, the fakes ^pop^!	只有*真身的王冠会闪光*。把英雄*放置*在*它旁边*：打中它，假货就会^破掉^！
Get your heroes *out*: *click* one to *pick him up*, *click* to *place* him.	把英雄*撤出来*：*点击*一名英雄*拿起*，再*点击*一次*放置*。
Heroes caught inside are ^stunned^ for {0} s. A slam that stuns nobody *dazes* the boss.	圈内的英雄会被^震晕^{0}秒。猛砸没震晕任何人，首领就会*眩晕*。
DAZED	眩晕
[SHIFT] *War Cry*! Your heroes *shout* and attack *faster* for a few seconds.	[SHIFT]*战吼*！英雄齐声*呐喊*，几秒内攻击*更快*。
Worth *{0}× gold*, but it *runs away* and escapes after {1} s on screen. *Place* your heroes *near it*!	价值*{0}倍金币*，但它会*逃跑*，在屏幕上{1}秒后就溜了。把英雄*放置*在*它附近*！
*Lots of gold*, and it splits into *{0} slimes*. But its HP is huge: *place* your heroes right next to it!	*金币很多*，还会分裂成*{0}只史莱姆*。但它HP极高：把英雄*放置*在它身边！
Your *screen*, your *heroes*, the *camp* and the boss's *lair* once found. Hold [TAB] for the big map!	显示你的*屏幕*、*英雄*、*营地*，以及找到后的首领*巢穴*。按住[TAB]查看大地图！
Your heroes now land with a *STOMP*: every slime around the landing gets *hurt*. *Place* them right *into a crowd*!	现在英雄落地时会*重踏*：落点周围的史莱姆都会*受伤*。直接把他们*放置*在*怪群*里！
Rolling *Stone Slimes* soak up your hits. *Place* your heroes *out of their path*!	滚动的*岩石史莱姆*会吸收你的攻击。把英雄*放置*在*它们的路线外*！
Every hit spills *gold*! *Place* your heroes next to it: more heroes hit it, more loot. Only *{0} seconds*!	每一击都会洒出*金币*！把英雄*放置*在它旁边：打它的英雄越多，战利品越多。只有*{0}秒*！
Its *bounty shrinks* every second! *Place* your heroes by it: it's *pinned* and every hit lands in *full*.	它的*赏金每秒都在缩水*！把英雄*放置*在它身边：它会被*定住*，每一击都能造成*全额*伤害。
Big *gold* or the *prize*? Catch *ONE*: the other runs off. *Place* your heroes by your pick!	要大把*金币*还是*奖品*？只能抓*一个*：另一个会跑掉。把英雄*放置*在你选的那个旁边！
*{0} Golden Slimes* fall and run! *Place* your heroes in their path and catch as many as you can!	*{0}只黄金史莱姆*从天而降，四散而逃！把英雄*放置*在它们的路线上，能抓多少抓多少！
Every level has a *boss* asleep in a *lair* far from camp. *Find* it, then press [SPACE] or *click its plaque* to *CHALLENGE* it: beat it before its clock runs out to open the *next level*!	每一关都有一个*首领*，沉睡在远离营地的*巢穴*里。*找到*它，然后按[SPACE]或*点击牌匾*发起*挑战*：在倒计时结束前击败它，就能开启*下一关*！
New heroes join as you grow. *{0} heroes* of a line make a *Job Change* into one stronger hero. *Helpers* throw slimes and pick up loot for you.	随着你不断成长，新英雄会陆续加入。同系*{0}名英雄*可以*转职*为一名更强的英雄。*帮手*会替你投掷史莱姆、拾取战利品。
Between runs, spend your gold at camp: the *SKILL TREE* makes you stronger, the *WARBAND* holds your *gear*, *CARDS* give bonuses, the *SHOP* sells potions, the *QUESTS* tab sends heroes away for loot. The *ADVENTURE BOOK* knows all you met.	每局之间，在营地花掉你的金币：*技能树*让你变强，*战团*存放*装备*，*卡牌*提供加成，*商店*出售药水，*任务*标签页派英雄外出寻宝。*冒险图鉴*记录着你遇到过的一切。
[A] place or pick up a hero, [Y] regroup, [RS] move the view, [UP] [RIGHT] [DOWN] [LEFT] ultimates, [LT] Lair Wing.	[A]放置或拿起英雄，[Y]集结，[RS]移动视野，[UP][RIGHT][DOWN][LEFT]终极技能，[LT]巢穴之翼。
Point at a tab and press [A].	指向一个标签页，然后按[A]。
See which hero did the *most damage* this run.	看看本局哪位英雄打出了*最高伤害*。
DAMAGE METER	伤害统计
Salvage spare gear into *Oridecon* for the forge. *Lock* what you want to keep.	把多余装备分解成*神之金属*，供锻造炉使用。想留的就*锁定*。
New: a *Charm slot* on every line! Put a *charm* in it in the *WARBAND*.	新功能：每系都有*护符栏*了！到*战团*给它装上*护符*。
CHARM SLOT	护符栏
New: a second *Charm slot* on every line! Fill it in the *WARBAND*.	新功能：每系新增第二个*护符栏*！到*战团*装上吧。
Send heroes on a *quest*. They're away for *{0} to {1} runs* and come back with *gear*, *cards* and *ore*.	派英雄去做*任务*。他们会外出*{0}到{1}局*，归来时带回*装备*、*卡牌*和*矿石*。
Your army is *smaller* meanwhile.	在此期间，你的军队人数会*减少*。
QUEST BOARD	任务板
Heroes of this line are on a quest. The Job Change waits until they're back.	这一系的英雄正在执行任务。转职要等他们回来。
