Move your *view* with [W] [A] [S] [D], or *drag* with the *middle* button.	用[W] [A] [S] [D]移动*视野*，或按住*中键*来*拖动*。
Hold [W] [A] [S] [D] or *drag with the middle button* to move your *view*: more slimes out there!	按住[W] [A] [S] [D]或*用中键拖动*来移动*视野*：外面还有更多史莱姆！
Push the *right stick* [RS] to move your *view*: more slimes out there!	推动*右摇杆*[RS]移动*视野*：外面还有更多史莱姆！
[LMB] place or pick up a hero, [Q] regroup, [MMB] drag: move the view, [{0}] [{1}] [{2}] [{3}] ultimates, [E] Lair Wing.	[LMB]放置或拿起英雄，[Q]集结，[MMB]拖动视野，[{0}][{1}][{2}][{3}]终极技能，[E]巢穴之翼。
Hold [X] and *move* the pointer to aim where it lands.	按住[X]并*移动*光标，瞄准落点。
Push [RS] to see the whole tree. [LB] [RB] zoom out and in.	推动[RS]查看整棵技能树。[LB][RB]缩小和放大。
Between runs, spend your gold at camp: the *SKILL TREE* makes you stronger, the *WARBAND* holds your *gear*, *CARDS* give bonuses. The *ADVENTURE BOOK* knows all you met.	每局之间，在营地花掉你的金币：*技能树*让你变强，*战团*存放*装备*，*卡牌*提供加成。*冒险图鉴*记录着你遇到过的一切。
Between runs, spend your gold at camp: the *SKILL TREE* makes you stronger, the *WARBAND* holds your *gear*, *CARDS* give bonuses, the *SHOP* sells potions. The *ADVENTURE BOOK* knows all you met.	每局之间，在营地花掉你的金币：*技能树*让你变强，*战团*存放*装备*，*卡牌*提供加成，*商店*出售药水。*冒险图鉴*记录着你遇到过的一切。
Between runs, spend your gold at camp: the *SKILL TREE* makes you stronger, the *WARBAND* holds your *gear*, *CARDS* give bonuses, the *QUESTS* tab sends heroes away for loot. The *ADVENTURE BOOK* knows all you met.	每局之间，在营地花掉你的金币：*技能树*让你变强，*战团*存放*装备*，*卡牌*提供加成，*任务*标签页派英雄外出寻宝。*冒险图鉴*记录着你遇到过的一切。
