A *second {T}* joins your army! Each one attacks *on its own* and shares every *{T1} upgrade*.	*第二名{T}*加入你的军队！每一名都会*独立*攻击，并共享所有*{T1}强化*。
A *third {T}* joins your army! Each one attacks *on its own* and shares every *{T1} upgrade*.	*第三名{T}*加入你的军队！每一名都会*独立*攻击，并共享所有*{T1}强化*。
A *fourth {T}* joins your army! Each one attacks *on its own* and shares every *{T1} upgrade*.	*第四名{T}*加入你的军队！每一名都会*独立*攻击，并共享所有*{T1}强化*。
