Shots *glance off*. [RMB] *Right-click* a *bug*: it flies at the boss and *cracks* the shell!	射击会被*弹开*。[RMB]*右键*点击*虫子*：它会飞向首领，*砸裂*硬壳！
Out here slimes have *×{0} HP* but drop *×{1} gold*. Your heroes are still weak: they would ^waste shots^ on them.	这里的史莱姆*HP×{0}*，但*金币×{1}*。你的英雄还太弱：打它们只会^白费火力^。
The boss is back in its *lair*. It fell before: beat it again for *a little gold*.	首领回到了*巢穴*。它曾败给你：再次击败可得*少量金币*。
No skill glows yet: your next run will bring more gold.	还没有技能亮起：下一局会带来更多金币。
It heals after every run: upgrade and come back!	每局结束后它都会回血：强化后再来！
Every level has a *boss* in a *lair* far from camp. Get near it and a *badge* on the edge of your screen shows the way. Beat it in *one run* to open the *next level*!	每一关都有一个*首领*，住在远离营地的*巢穴*里。靠近它时，屏幕边缘的*徽标*会指路。在*一局*内击败它，就能开启*下一关*！
*STORM CALL* charges during runs. When it's *READY*: *click* its tile or press [{0}]: it strikes the slimes on screen *at once*!	*召唤风暴*会在每局中充能。显示*就绪*时，*点击*技能图标或按[{0}]：*瞬间*劈向屏幕上的史莱姆！
*HOLD THE LINE* charges during runs. When it's *READY*: *click* its tile or press [{0}]: every slime on screen is *pulled* to your Swordsmen, who sweep *twice as fast*!	*坚守阵线*会在每局中充能。显示*就绪*时，*点击*技能图标或按[{0}]：屏幕上的史莱姆都会被*拉*向你的剑士，剑士横扫速度*翻倍*！
