ROGUE'S TRIAL: Steal {0} bonus coins with Pickpocket in one run.	盗贼试炼：在一局内用顺手牵羊偷到{0}枚额外金币。
SWORDSMAN'S TRIAL: Land {0} Sweeps that each hit {1} or more slimes in one run.	剑士试炼：在一局内打出{0}次横扫，每次至少命中{1}只史莱姆。
Land {0} strikes that each hit {1} or more slimes with the Mage line in one run.	在一局内用法师系打出{0}次攻击，每次至少命中{1}只史莱姆。
