*TOSS* its bugs at its *SHELL* to crack it. At night, *CROWN GUARDS* come next!	*投掷*它的虫子砸裂*硬壳*。夜晚接着是*王冠护卫*！
Down its guards' trios and dodge its *red circles*. At night, its *SHELL* comes first!	击倒护卫三人组，并躲开它的*红圈*。夜晚先要对付*硬壳*！
