HOLD TO LEAVE	按住离开战斗
~HEALER~ mends, *SHIELDER* guards it, ^BRUTE^ hits hard. Down them by their *numbers*: *{0}* first!	~医师~会治疗，*盾卫*会保护它，^蛮兵^下手很重。跟着*数字*打：先打*{0}*号！
*NEW BEST* gear beats what you wear: put it on in the *WARBAND*!	标着*更强*的装备比你身上的更好：去*战团*换上吧！
Every try costs *Oridecon* and gold. A *fail* keeps the level and adds *+{0}%* to the next.	每次精炼都要*神之金属*和金币。*失败*会保留等级，下次成功率*+{0}%*。
A fail keeps it, +{0}% next try	失败保留等级，下次+{0}%
Opens the Warband: every hero line gets a weapon slot, slimes start dropping bags of rolled gear, and its forge refines the slots with salvaged Oridecon and gold.	开启战团：每个英雄系获得一个武器栏位，史莱姆开始掉落装有随机属性装备的物品袋，锻造炉可用分解得来的神之金属和金币精炼栏位。
Every refine needs *Oridecon*: *salvage* spare gear here to get it.	每次精炼都需要*神之金属*：在这里*分解*多余装备即可获得。
The Mage's ULTIMATE, earned by his TRIAL (no gold). Its meter fills as the run goes on; full, press {0}: the Wizard's Chain Lightning strikes every slime on your screen. The Thunder Mage calls the storm instead: for {1} seconds {2} colossal bolts crash down, each worth {3} strikes in a huge blast, jumping on to {4} more slimes. The Archmage calls both.	法师的终极技能，完成他的试炼即可获得（无需金币）。能量条会随着本局进行而充能；充满后按{0}键：巫师的闪电链会击中屏幕上的每一只史莱姆。雷法师则改为召唤风暴：{1}秒内，{2}道巨型闪电轰然落下，每道都会在大范围爆炸中造成{3}次打击，并跳跃到另外{4}只史莱姆身上。大法师两者都会召唤。
ULTIMATE: a chain through every slime on screen	终极技能：闪电链击中屏幕上每一只史莱姆
ULTIMATE: the chain, then {0} colossal bolts	终极技能：先是闪电链，再落下{0}道巨型闪电
The Mage line's *ULTIMATE*: press [{0}] or click its tile. The Wizard's chain strikes *every slime* on screen, the Thunder Mage calls a *storm* of bolts, the Archmage *both*.	法师系的*终极技能*：按[{0}]或点击技能图标。巫师的闪电链会击中屏幕上的*每一只史莱姆*，雷法师召唤闪电*风暴*，大法师*两者兼备*。
*STORM CALL* is ready: press [{0}]. Best on a *full screen* of slimes!	*召唤风暴*已就绪：按[{0}]。屏幕上*史莱姆越多*越好！
[LMB] place or move a hero, [Q] regroup, [RMB] [MMB] drag: move the view, [{0}] [{1}] [{2}] [{3}] ultimates, [E] Lair Wing.	[LMB]放置或移动英雄，[Q]集结，[RMB][MMB]拖动视野，[{0}][{1}][{2}][{3}]终极技能，[E]巢穴之翼。
[LMB] place or move a hero, [Q] regroup, [MMB] drag: move the view, [{0}] [{1}] [{2}] [{3}] ultimates, [E] Lair Wing.	[LMB]放置或移动英雄，[Q]集结，[MMB]拖动视野，[{0}][{1}][{2}][{3}]终极技能，[E]巢穴之翼。
[A] place or move a hero, [Y] regroup, [RS] move the view, [UP] [RIGHT] [DOWN] [LEFT] ultimates, [LT] Lair Wing.	[A]放置或移动英雄，[Y]集结，[RS]移动视野，[UP][RIGHT][DOWN][LEFT]终极技能，[LT]巢穴之翼。
You have *heroes in hand*. *Click* the ground to place one, *drag* a line to place more. They *stay where you put them*: [Q] *Regroup* brings them all back. Your *Barbarian* walks by himself: he *roars* at one hero, who attacks *faster*, and *throws* slimes into packs.	你的*手牌里有英雄*。*点击*地面放置一名，*拖动*划线放置多名。他们*放哪就待哪*：按[Q]*集结*可全部召回。*野蛮人*会自行游走：他会对一位英雄*大吼*，使其攻击*更快*，还会把史莱姆*扔*进怪群。
Every slot is busy	栏位已满
Salvage every unlocked item: {T}	分解所有未锁定的物品：{T}
Locked items and upgrades are kept	锁定的物品和更好的物品会保留
REFINE ALL	全部精炼
One try on every slot you can refine, the cheapest first	对每个可精炼的栏位各试一次，从最便宜的开始
{0} of {1} slots refined	精炼成功的栏位：{0}/{1}
Unlock the Rogue, a helper who joins every run by himself. Every few seconds he dashes out, cuts a slime and steals a handful of coins.	解锁盗贼：每局都会自动加入的帮手。每隔几秒，他就会冲出去砍一只史莱姆，偷走一把金币。
He joins every run *by himself*: no need to place him.	他每局都会*自动加入*：无需放置。
A new hero for your hand! Place him and he walks the field by himself: he ROARS at one hero (it attacks {0}% faster for {1} seconds).	手牌中的新英雄！放置后他会自行在战场上游走：对一位英雄发出咆哮（{1}秒内攻速提高{0}%）。
Place him: he *walks* by himself and *roars* at one hero.	放置后，他会自行*游走*，并对一位英雄发出*咆哮*。
Your *Barbarian* is in your hand: *place* him! He *walks* by himself and *roars* at one hero, who attacks *faster*.	*野蛮人*已在你的手牌中：*放置*他吧！他会自行*游走*，对一位英雄*大吼*，使其攻击*更快*。
The *Barbarian* walks by himself: he *roars* at one hero, who attacks *faster*.	*野蛮人*会自行游走：他会对一位英雄*大吼*，使其攻击*更快*。
Down its guards' trios and dodge its *red circles*.	击倒护卫三人组，并躲开它的*红圈*。
Hero landings freeze nearby slimes for {0} s.	英雄落地时，附近的史莱姆冻结{0}秒。
