Your {0} Archers become {1} Hunter. He keeps every upgrade and is much stronger. PIERCE: he fires one heavy arrow that flies on through the slime it hits.	你的{0}名弓箭手转职为{1}名猎手。他保留所有强化，实力大增。穿透：他射出一支重箭，命中史莱姆后还会继续向前飞。
Your {0} Hunters become {1} Ranger. He keeps every upgrade and is much stronger. POWER SHOT: every {2}th arrow pierces every slime in its line and always crits.	你的{0}名猎手转职为{1}名游侠。他保留所有强化，实力大增。强力射击：每{2}支箭就有一支贯穿直线上的所有史莱姆，且必定暴击。
Your {0} Wizards become {1} Thunder Mage. He keeps every upgrade, is much stronger and strikes a bigger area. CHAIN LIGHTNING: each strike jumps on to {2} more slimes, {3}% less a jump.	你的{0}名巫师转职为{1}名雷法师。他保留所有强化，实力大增，打击范围更大。闪电链：每次打击还会跳向另外{2}只史莱姆，每跳一次伤害降低{3}%。
Your {0} Thunder Mages become {1} Archmage. He keeps every upgrade and is much stronger. CHAIN REACTION: slimes his chain hits stay charged {2} s; a charged slime that dies sends a free jump on.	你的{0}名雷法师转职为{1}名大法师。他保留所有强化，实力大增。连锁反应：被他的闪电链命中的史莱姆会带电{2}秒；带电的史莱姆死亡时，会免费再跳出一道闪电。
Your {0} Swordsmen become {1} Knight. He keeps every upgrade and is much stronger. SHIELD BASH: every few seconds he charges a short line and knocks its slimes into a pile in front of him.	你的{0}名剑士转职为{1}名骑士。他保留所有强化，实力大增。盾击：每隔几秒，他会向前冲锋一小段，把沿途的史莱姆撞到面前堆成一堆。
Your {0} Knights become {1} Blademaster. He keeps every upgrade and is much stronger. WHIRLWIND: every {2} s he spins for {3} s and hits every slime in reach {4} times.	你的{0}名骑士转职为{1}名剑圣。他保留所有强化，实力大增。旋风斩：每{2}秒，他会旋转{3}秒，对范围内的所有史莱姆打击{4}次。
